/// Goblin's current behaviour (owner, 2026-10-06: the docs predate Goblin and are not
/// canonical). Was a docs-vs-engine gap: cheat-sheet: 'x between a..b' is inclusive; both treat the upper bound as exclusive
x | 3
say(x between 1..5)
say(5 between 1..5)
say(0 between 1..5)
if x between 1..5 => say("in")
